@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
hide circle
class Group
class ScheduleInterval {
  weekdays, startTime, endTime
  from, to
}
class "CalendarEvent" as Ev <<existing>>
class Session
Group *-- "1..*" ScheduleInterval
ScheduleInterval ..> Ev : writes a copy >
Session "0..1" .. "1" ScheduleInterval
note bottom of Ev
  Two places to keep in sync;
  single-date changes need their own model.
end note
@enduml
